@startuml
title Browser abuse flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ReferenceBackgroundColor #111111
skinparam ReferenceBorderColor #111111
skinparam ReferenceFontColor #ffffff

actor User
participant "Worker Engine" as Worker
participant "Rate Limiter/Load Balancer\n(Traefik)" as RateLimiter
participant "Remediation Middleware\n(crowdsec-bouncer-traefik-plugin)" as Middleware
participant "Security Engine\n(CrowdSec)" as SecurityEngine
participant "Worker Server" as WorkerServer
participant "Web Resource" as WebResource

User -> RateLimiter: GET /
RateLimiter -> Middleware: browser-page-enforcement-chain
Middleware -> SecurityEngine: check remediation by source IP
SecurityEngine --> Middleware: captcha decision
Middleware --> User: serve challenge.html

User -> WorkerServer: GET /static/{pluginId}/.../challenge-*.js
WorkerServer --> Worker: challenge JS bundle

ref over User, WorkerServer : Solve Challenge
ref over User, Middleware : Validate Challenge

Middleware --> User: set captcha pass (grace) + redirect to original URL
User -> RateLimiter: follow redirect GET /
RateLimiter -> Middleware: check pass/grace state
Middleware --> RateLimiter: allow
RateLimiter -> WebResource: forward request
WebResource --> User: 200 OK page

@enduml
